╭─ Issue description ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ Issue Title: [BUG]  Ollama provider has swapped input/output token counts                                                                       │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ Description:                                                                                                                                    │
│ ### Checks                                                                                                                                      │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ -  I have updated to the lastest minor and patch version of Strands                                                                             │
│ -  I have checked the documentation and this is not expected behavior                                                                           │
│ -  I have searched [./issues](./issues?q=) and there are no duplicates of my issue                                                              │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ ### Strands Version                                                                                                                             │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ 1.33.0                                                                                                                                          │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ ### Python Version                                                                                                                              │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ 3.12.4                                                                                                                                          │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ ### Operating System                                                                                                                            │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ macOS 15.7.3                                                                                                                                    │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ ### Installation Method                                                                                                                         │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ pip                                                                                                                                             │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ ### Steps to Reproduce                                                                                                                          │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ 1. Use the Ollama model provider with any model                                                                                                 │
│ 2. Run an agent invocation                                                                                                                      │
│ 3. Inspect the usage metrics (e.g. `agent.event_loop_metrics.accumulated_usage`)                                                                │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ ### Expected Behavior                                                                                                                           │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ `inputTokens` should reflect the number of tokens in the prompt, and `outputTokens` should reflect the number of tokens generated by the model, │
│ consistent with [Ollama's API documentation](https://github.com/ollama/ollama/blob/main/docs/api.md)/ https://docs.ollama.com/api/usage:        │
│ - `prompt_eval_count` — "number of tokens in the prompt" (input)                                                                                │
│ - `eval_count` — "number of tokens in the response" (output)                                                                                    │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ ### Actual Behavior                                                                                                                             │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ `inputTokens` and `outputTokens` are swapped. At `src/strands/models/ollama.py:276-277`, `eval_count` (output) is mapped to `inputTokens` and   │
│ `prompt_eval_count` (input) is mapped to `outputTokens`:                                                                                        │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ ```python                                                                                                                                       │
│ "inputTokens": event["data"].eval_count,        # wrong — this is output                                                                        │
│ "outputTokens": event["data"].prompt_eval_count, # wrong — this is input                                                                        │
│ ```                                                                                                                                             │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ `totalTokens` is coincidentally correct since addition is commutative.                                                                          │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ ### Additional Context                                                                                                                          │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ This affects all downstream consumers of per-field token metrics for Ollama users:                                                              │
│ - `accumulated_usage["inputTokens"]` and `accumulated_usage["outputTokens"]` are swapped                                                        │
│ - OpenTelemetry metrics (`event_loop_input_tokens`, `event_loop_output_tokens`) report swapped values                                           │
│ - Any per-cycle or per-invocation usage inspection shows incorrect input/output breakdown                                                       │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ ### Possible Solution                                                                                                                           │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ Swap the two mappings at `src/strands/models/ollama.py:276-277`:                                                                                │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ ```python                                                                                                                                       │
│ "inputTokens": event["data"].prompt_eval_count,                                                                                                 │
│ "outputTokens": event["data"].eval_count,                                                                                                       │
│ ```                                                                                                                                             │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ ### Related Issues                                                                                                                              │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ _No response_                                                                                                                                   │
